### 📄 Full HTML + JS (Single-File Demo)

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Coffee-Making Simulator</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      padding: 20px;
